s picked; or a filesystem URL for the movie, if a movie was picked. The dictionary also contains any relevant editing information. The keys for this dictionary are listed in Editing Information Keys."}]}],"name":"info"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your delegate object’s implementation of this method should pass the specified media on to any custom code that needs it, and should then dismiss the camera controller view."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Implementation of this method is optional, but expected."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.hvt.horizonsdk.framework\/documentation\/HorizonSDK\/HVTCameraControllerDelegate\/cameraController:didFinishCapturingMediaWithInfo:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/horizonsdk\/hvtcameracontrollerdelegate\/cameracontroller:didfinishcapturingmediawithinfo:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Tells the delegate that the user picked a still image or movie."}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://com.hvt.horizonsdk.framework/documentation/HorizonSDK/HVTCameraControllerDelegate":{"url":"\/documentation\/horizonsdk\/hvtcameracontrollerdelegate","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.hvt.horizonsdk.framework\/documentation\/HorizonSDK\/HVTCameraControllerDelegate","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"HVTCameraControllerDelegate"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The HVTCameraControllerDelegate protocol defines methods that your delegate object must implement to interact with the camera controller interface. The methods of this protocol notify your delegate when the user either finishes capturing an image or movie, or cancels the camera operation."}],"title":"HVTCameraControllerDelegate","